:: Deadwood BirdTower Hunt People Watching []
<<effects>>
<<if maplebirch.get('BirdTower').selectTrait("sympathy")>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      You nod and catch up with the two people. <<childrenNames _tempIDs>> screech happily, and <<babyhawksthem>> follow you.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      你点点头，追上了那两个人。<<childrenNames _tempIDs>>高兴地尖鸣，<<babyhawksthem>>跟上了你。
  <</language>>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      You tell your <<babyhawks>> that you want to follow them.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      你告诉你的<<babyhawks>>，你想跟着他们。
  <</language>>
  <<if maplebirch.get('BirdTower').leaderTrait isnot "none">>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        <<childname $BirdTower.hunt.leader>> seems a little doubtful about the idea.
        Even so, <<childhe $BirdTower.hunt.leader>> is willing to do as you say.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        <<childname $BirdTower.hunt.leader>>似乎对这个主意有些疑虑。
        尽管如此，<<childhe $BirdTower.hunt.leader>>还是愿意按你说的做。
    <</language>>
  <<else>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        <<babyhawks>> chatter in reply.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        <<babyhawks>>叽喳着回应你。
    <</language>>
  <</if>>
  <br><br>
<</if>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    You fly closer to them, and now you can clearly make out the
  <<option 'CN'>>
    你飞得离他们更近了些，现在你能清楚看清那个
<</language>>
<<generate1>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    <<person1>><<person>> and the
  <<option 'CN'>>
    <<person1>><<person>>和
<</language>>
<<generatep2 1>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    <<person2>><<person>>.
    You and <<babyhawks>> trail them for a while, wondering what they are up to.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    <<person2>><<person>>了。
    你和<<babyhawks>>尾随了他们一会儿，想知道他们要做什么。
<</language>>
<br><br>
<<cleareventpool>>
<<addinlineevent "babyhawk_hunt_people_1">>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      After following them for some time,
    <<option 'CN'>>
      在跟踪了一段时间后，
  <</language>>
  <<if $rng gte 66>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        you notice they are walking in circles. Both of them seem very alert. You guess they are on patrol, though you do not know why.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        你发现他们正绕圈走着。两人似乎都很警惕。你猜测他们正在巡逻，虽然并不知道原因。
    <</language>>
  <<elseif $rng gte 33>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        you do not notice them doing anything in particular.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        你并没有发现他们有什么特殊的行动。
    <</language>>
  <<else>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        you begin to think they must be lost. Or at least, they probably do not know where they want to go.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        你开始觉得他们应该是迷路了。或者至少，他们应该并不知道自己想去哪里。
    <</language>>
  <</if>>
  <<if maplebirch.get('BirdTower').selectTrait("sympathy")>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        <<childrenNames _tempIDs>> circle around you as they fly, watching the two walk and chattering with interest.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        <<childrenNames _tempIDs>>在你身边绕圈飞行着，看着两人走动，发出感兴趣的叽喳叫。
    <</language>>
  <</if>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      You feel you have seen enough, so you stop following them.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      你觉得已经看够了，于是停止了跟踪。
  <</language>>
  <br><br>
  <<endevent>>
  <<babyhawk_hunt_options>>
<</addinlineevent>>
<<addinlineevent "babyhawk_hunt_people_2">>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      You notice they stop now and then to admire the scenery.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      你注意到他们不时停下，欣赏风景。
  <</language>>
  <<if $rng gte 66>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        <<person1>><<person>> stands very close to <<person2>><<person>>. After approaching a field of flowers, <<person1>><<person>> stops and kisses <<person2>><<person>> passionately. It is a very cute sight.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        <<person1>><<person>>挨得离<<person2>><<person>>很近。在接近一片花田后，<<person1>><<person>>停了下来，热情地亲吻了<<person2>><<person>>。这一幕十分可爱。
    <</language>>
    <<trauma -2>><<ltrauma>>
  <<elseif $rng gte 33>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        Whenever they stop, <<person2>><<person>> writes something in a notebook. You wonder what <<hes>> is recording.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        每当他们停下，<<person2>><<person>>都会在笔记本上写下什么。你想知道<<hes>>在记录什么。
    <</language>>
  <<else>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        The moor is usually far too dangerous to cross, but these two do not seem to care. They stop at various spots now and then.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        荒原通常都太危险，并不适合穿越，但这两人似乎并不在意这点。他们不时在各种地点停下。
    <</language>>
  <</if>>
  <br><br>
  <<if maplebirch.get('BirdTower').selectTrait("sympathy")>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        <<childrenNames _tempIDs>> chatter and fly lower, following the two while trying to see the scenery around them from the same angle.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        <<childrenNames _tempIDs>>叽喳叫着，飞得更低，一边跟随这两人，一边试图在同样的视角观看周围的风景。
    <</language>>
    <<= _length gt 1 ? lanSwitch("They","他们") : "<<childhe _tempIDs>>" >>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        soon fly back to your side.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        很快又飞回了你身边。
    <</language>>
  <</if>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      You keep following them for a while, then lose interest.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      你继续跟了他们一会儿，然后失去了兴趣。
  <</language>>
  <br><br>
  <<endevent>>
  <<babyhawk_hunt_options>>
<</addinlineevent>>
<<addinlineevent "babyhawk_hunt_people_3">>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      They walk on for a while, then stop and sit down. <<person1>><<person>> takes two cans of drink out of a backpack. <<He>> hands one to <<person2>><<person>>, and they drink together. They sit there, laughing and shoving each other playfully. When they finish their drinks, they get up and toss the empty cans into a nearby hole.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      他们继续走了一会儿，然后停下，坐了下来。<<person1>><<person>>从背包里拿出两听罐装饮料。<<He>>将一听递给<<person2>><<person>>，他们一起喝起饮料。他们坐在原地，笑着，互相推搡着。等到他们将饮料喝完后，他们起身，将空罐扔进了一个附近的洞里。
  <</language>>
  <br><br>
  <<if maplebirch.get('BirdTower').leaderTrait is "clever">>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        <<childname $BirdTower.hunt.leader>> seems very surprised that they threw away something so shiny.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        <<childname $BirdTower.hunt.leader>>似乎对于他们将闪亮亮的东西扔掉非常惊讶。
    <</language>>
  <</if>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Seeing humans litter, you feel
    <<option 'CN'>>
      看见人类乱扔垃圾，你感到很
  <</language>>
  <<= $submissive lte 500 ? lanSwitch("uncomfortable","不适") : lanSwitch("ashamed","羞愧")>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      . At least you can make sure the empty cans do not stay here. After they leave, you land and take the cans.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      ，至少你可以做到让空罐不留在这里。他们离开后，你降落下去，拿走了这些空罐。
  <</language>>
  <<flight_hunt_get "junk" 2>>
  <br><br>
  <<endevent>>
  <<babyhawk_hunt_options>>
<</addinlineevent>>
<<addinlineevent "babyhawk_hunt_people_4">>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      After a while, they stop and sit on some rocks to rest. <<person1>><<person>> starts saying something to <<person2>><<person>>.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      过了一会儿，他们停下来，坐在几块石头上休息。<<person1>><<person>>开始和<<person2>><<person>>说着什么。
  <</language>>
  <<if $rng gte 66>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        A few minutes later, their conversation grows heated, and both of them are shouting at each other. For a moment you think the argument will escalate into a fight, but then the two of them suddenly start laughing. After that, the conversation returns to normal.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        几分钟后，他们的谈话变得激烈起来，双方都在互相大声喊叫。有一刻你以为争吵会升级到肢体冲突，但他们俩却突然开始笑了起来。之后，谈话恢复了正常。
    <</language>>
  <<elseif $rng gte 33>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        They seem to be having a light conversation. They look a little out of breath from walking.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        他们似乎在进行轻松的谈话。他们看起来有些因为步行而气喘嘘嘘。
    <</language>>
  <<else>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        Their conversation goes on for quite a while, and you begin to wonder whether they will ever stop.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        他们的谈话持续了好一会儿，你甚至想知道他们到底会不会停下。
    <</language>>
  <</if>>
  <br><br>
  <<if maplebirch.get('BirdTower').selectTrait("clever")>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        You turn to look at your children. <<childrenNames _tempIDs>> seem to be listening to their conversation carefully. You wonder
      <<option 'CN'>>
        你转头看向你的孩子。<<childrenNames _tempIDs>>似乎在认真地听着他们的谈话。你好奇
    <</language>>
    <<= _length gt 1 ? lanSwitch("They","他们") : "<<childhe _tempIDs>>" >>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        how much they understand.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        能听懂多少。
    <</language>>
  <<elseif maplebirch.get('BirdTower').selectTrait("sympathy")>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        You turn to look at your children. <<childrenNames _tempIDs>> seem quite curious about these two, watching them intently.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        你转头看向你的孩子。<<childrenNames _tempIDs>>似乎对这两人相当好奇，认真地盯着他们观察。
    <</language>>
  <<else>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        You turn to look at your children. <<childname $BirdTower.hunt.leader>> seems a little bored.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        你转头看向你的孩子。<<childname $BirdTower.hunt.leader>>似乎有些无聊。
    <</language>>
  <</if>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      At last, their conversation ends. They stand up, and you notice <<person1>><<person>>'s wallet slip out. <<He>> walks away without noticing it is gone. Once you are sure they are gone, you land and take the wallet.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      终于，他们的谈话结束。他们站起身，你注意到<<person1>><<person>>的钱包掉了出来。<<He>>走开了，没有注意到钱包不见了。你确保他们走掉了后，降落下去，拿走了钱包。
  <</language>>
  <<flight_hunt_get "valuables" 1 "wallet">>
  <br><br>
  <<if maplebirch.get('BirdTower').leaderTrait is "clever">>
    <<childSelect $BirdTower.hunt.leader>>
    <<childname>><<= $cmonster ? lanSwitch("claps happily","开心地拍手") : lanSwitch("screeches","尖鸣着")>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        , very pleased with your new find.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        ，对你们的新发现很满意。
    <</language>>
    <br><br>
  <</if>>
  <<endevent>>
  <<babyhawk_hunt_options>>
<</addinlineevent>>
<<addinlineevent "babyhawk_hunt_people_5">>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      You notice they are walking through a more dangerous part of the moor, where most people would not go. A few minutes later, you notice them approaching a resting lurker. Both of them crouch down and approach it quietly. <<person1>><<person>> takes a net out of <<his>> backpack and closes the distance.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      你注意到他们正走在荒原更加艰险的区域，大多数人都不会做这种事。几分钟后，你注意到他们正在接近一只休息中的潜伏者。他们俩都蹲下来，悄悄地靠近它。<<person1>><<person>>从<<his>>的背包里拿出一张网，缩短了距离。
  <</language>>
  <br><br>
  <<if $rng gte 50>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        <<He>> throws the net. The lurker is too fast and just barely dodges it. <<person2>><<person>> tries to block it, but the lurker still slips between <<his>> legs.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        <<He>>将网扔了出去。潜伏者速度太快了，刚好躲开了网。<<person2>><<person>>想要拦住它，但潜伏者还是从<<his>>两腿间溜走了。
    <</language>>
    <<if maplebirch.get('BirdTower').selectTrait("dominant")>>
      <<childrenNames _tempIDs>>
      <<if _length gt 1>>
        <<language>>
          <<option 'EN'>>
            at the same time
          <<option 'CN'>>
            同时
        <</language>>
      <</if>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          make
        <<option 'CN'>>
          发出
      <</language>>
      <<= $cmonster ? lanSwitch(" a string of giggling laughs.","一串咯咯的笑声。") : lanSwitch(" a string of short chirps, as if laughing.","一连串短促的叽叽叫，似乎是笑了起来。")>>
    <</if>>
  <<else>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        <<He>> hides behind a nearby bush and waits for the right moment. <<He>> throws the net, it hits the target, and the lurker is caught. The two of them rush at it together and put the netted lurker into <<person1>><<person>>'s backpack.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        <<He>>藏在附近的一丛灌木后面，等待着合适的时机。<<He>>将网扔了出去，它命中目标，网住了潜伏者。两人一起冲向它，并将网着的潜伏者放进了<<person1>><<person>>的背包里。
    <</language>>
    <<childSelect $BirdTower.hunt.leader>>
    <<if maplebirch.get('BirdTower').leaderTrait is "dominant">>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          <<childname>> squawks, as if regretting that <<childhimself>> did not snatch this prey first.
        <<option 'CN'>>
          <<childname>>嘎嘎叫着，好像很遗憾<<childhimself>>没能抢先抓走这只猎物。
      <</language>>
    <<elseif maplebirch.get('BirdTower').leaderTrait is "clever">>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          <<childname>> seems curious about their net.
        <<option 'CN'>>
          <<childname>>似乎对他们的网很好奇。
      <</language>>
    <<else>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          <<childname>> seems very impressed by this.
        <<option 'CN'>>
          <<childname>>对此似乎非常印象深刻。
      <</language>>
    <</if>>
  <</if>>
  <br><br>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      They turn and head back the way they came. There is no need to follow them any further now.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      他们转身向着来时的路返回。现在没必要再跟着他们了。
  <</language>>
  <br><br>
  <<endevent>>
  <<babyhawk_hunt_options>>
<</addinlineevent>>
<<addinlineevent "babyhawk_hunt_people_6">>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      At last, they come to a small tree. <<person1>><<person>> takes two axes out of <<his>> backpack. <<he>> hands one to <<person2>><<person>>, then moves to the other side of the tree. They start chopping, and it takes them only a few minutes to cut it down completely. Then they split the tree into small pieces and put them in their backpacks.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      最终，他们来到了一棵小树旁。<<person1>><<person>>从<<his>>的背包里拿出两把斧头。<<he>>把其中一把递给了<<person2>><<person>>，然后移动到树的对面。他们开始砍伐树木，只用了几分钟就将其完全砍倒。然后他们把树木劈成小块，放进了背包里。
  <</language>>
  <<if maplebirch.get('BirdTower').selectTrait("clumsy")>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        <<childname _tempIDs[0]>> seems frustrated that they cannot use tools the way the humans do.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        <<childname _tempIDs[0]>>似乎对于自己并不能像他们那样用工具感到很沮丧。
    <</language>>
  <</if>>
  <<if maplebirch.get('BirdTower').selectTrait("clever")>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        <<childrenNames _tempIDs>> seem very interested in the axes with their silver sheen.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        <<childrenNames _tempIDs>>似乎对发着银光的斧头很感兴趣。
    <</language>>
  <</if>>
  <br><br>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      After gathering as much wood as they can, they leave. You land on the ground and check what is left behind.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      在收集到尽可能多的木材之后，他们离开了。你们降落到地上，查看剩下的东西。
  <</language>>
  <<if $rng gte 30>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        They took almost everything, leaving only the parts they did not need. Still, you can find a few things useful to you, though not many.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        他们几乎将所有东西都拿走了，只留下了不需要的部分。但你还是能找到些对你有用的东西，虽然并不多。
    <</language>>
    <<flight_hunt_get "sticks" 1>>
  <<else>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        They left behind many smaller branches.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        他们留下了许多更小的树枝。
    <</language>>
    <<flight_hunt_get "sticks" 2>>
  <</if>>
  <br><br>
  <<endevent>>
  <<babyhawk_hunt_return>>
<</addinlineevent>>
<<runeventpool>>
